Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:32:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Prepare isolated coordinated shutdown integration candidate

Connect local tracker reports to an opt-in finalizer after outer-wrapper JAX use. Preserve application failures, record drain failures and serialize producer admission with shutdown. Keep launch recipes unchanged.

Thirty-six local checks use fake external boundaries. Real package initialization, ONLINE multi-host behavior and controller aggregation remain unqualified. This is a development checkpoint, not a deployed repair.
